  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Test Record 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Test 2
  content: 'Just shut out the voices inside your head

    I''ll reach out and take
    you back from the edge

    The battle is calling us to our graves

    Beneath
    the waves but we fight back to the ending

    No ending in sight, yeah, I got
    you in my sights

    Oh, I''m coming for you, coming for you

    Chaos on
    my mind, yeah, built in the struggle

    The war wages on, yeah, we keep fighting
    until

    We are all that remains

    There is no white flag to raise'
